rap entry is hand-written.** The `typescript` entry in `npm-shrinkwrap.json` (lockfile v1) has no `integrity`, no `requires` and no entries for the native compiler's platform packages. The doc admits this. Please attach evidence that `npm ci` at the root, with this shrinkwrap, installs a working `tsc`. If it cannot, regenerate the shrinkwrap with network access.\n\nNot blocking, but worth noting: the `prepare` script makes `npm ci` fail on Node older than 22.13, and the doc and `package.json` don't state that requirement.\n\nVERDICT: REJECT Untrack the committed generated DocService/sources/utilsDocService.js (git rm --cached; the packet says emitted .js must not be committed), and show that npm ci with the hand-written typescript shrinkwrap entry installs a working tsc, or regenerate the shrinkwrap.","ttft_ms":2763,"type":"result","duration_ms":78885,"uuid":"985b5299-90e2-44d8-94f7-ce49e4d9e81e","ttft_stream_ms":1506,"time_to_request_ms":494,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":5,"system_prompt":279,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":4,"input_attachments":20,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":64,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":14,"init_frame_send":6,"engine_pickup":2,"loop_entry":5,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":4,"request_announcements":28,"query_setup":3,"auto_mode_context_wait":9,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":22,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":5,"request_build":17},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":67,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":300,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":215,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":139,"process_rss_mib_result":240,"process_anon_mib_result":148,"process_peak_rss_mib":254,"process_cpu_ms_turn":2358,"process_wall_ms_turn":78884,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":852,"process_wall_ms_streaming":38229,"main_stream_count":14,"main_stream_event_count":716,"main_stream_chunk_count":145,"input_attachments_detail":